  (text "Five identical 16-wire JST NSHD ports. TOF_VIO is strapped to P3V3 by default; CS/INT/DET pull to TOF_VIO."
    (at 12.00 12.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b7d937c7-5ce5-41dd-af68-11dd21aaacc1")
  )

  (text "Pins 11/12 carry optional I3C/I2C bring-up only; SPI remains the primary high-rate sensor transport."
    (at 12.00 22.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "32556d5f-0848-4615-b3ad-f6056bc14191")
  )

  (text "Each sensor port has an active-low MCU-sunk data/status LED for firmware found-and-streaming indication."
    (at 12.00 32.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "b92c01f5-e414-403c-b51e-2402d4228ef9")
  )

  (text "Each sensor port uses ESD204DQA low-cap arrays for SPI, shared I3C/control, and DET protection at the connector."
    (at 12.00 42.00 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "4976ea74-ccdd-4de5-8ed4-7fcd5d361d7d")
  )

